You are approaching the old shed. Here you know every trail, every crack. How many times you played here, imagining yourself in caves of another island, or inside an airship!
You step inside. There is a workbench surrounded by piles of long, waved shavings. Various gardening tools are standing in the corner by the workbench. On the other side father nailed a few shelves with multifarious stuff. 
There is a small, metal canister with long spout on one of the shelves. Father uses it to deal with weed in the garden. The liquid inside astonishes and frightens you at the same time: weed wither momentarily after this stuff and nothing can crow there for a long time. 
You heard frightening rumors that cannibal-plants do grow on the Wild Island. After looking around you take the canister and put it in your satchel. Now you feel yourself more safe.  